  "packageHash": "Ei+Orh1fakRJL2amIkxNcZ8SMApblCywiBd8Y3MaN7BW22aj+qUUD0sjTyDwfStmbj9p15TKh/0I992EC8zM+A==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 538748,
  "published": "2026-09-10T23:46:09.153Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- The workbook is closed as soon as it has been read. Until 1.0.1 it stayed locked until the garbage collector released it, so it could not be moved, overwritten or deleted right after reading.\n- Worksheet indexes count from zero on .NET Framework too, as documented. Until 1.0.1 a .NET Framework application could not read worksheet 0, and worksheet 1 returned the first sheet: if you were passing 1-based indexes there, subtract one.\n- Builds for .NET 8, 9 and 10 alongside .NET Standard 2.0.\n- System.Drawing.Common and System.Text.Encodings.Web raised to 10.0.12, which fixes the critical advisories of the 4.7.0 builds that EPPlusFree brings in.",
